---
// Left-margin instrument: the environmental gradient as a vertical scale,
// with a reading-head that descends on scroll. Echoes the cave light gradient
// (entrance → aphotic zone) and doubles as a scroll-position indicator.
---
<aside class="axis" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="axis__bar"></div>
  <div class="axis__ticks"></div>
  <div class="axis__marker"></div>
</aside>
